                 ╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────╮
                 │                                             │
                 │ F5 Ctrl+E         Run statement/selection   │
                 │ Shift+F5          Run the whole script      │
                 │ Ctrl+R            Query history             │
                 │ Ctrl+N            New query tab             │
                 │ Ctrl+W            Close query tab           │
                 │ Alt+] Ctrl+PgDn   Next query tab            │
                 │ Alt+[ Ctrl+PgUp   Previous query tab        │
                 │ Ctrl+C            Copy / cancel query       │
                 │ y                 Copy as CSV, JSON, …      │
                 │ Ctrl+X            Cut                       │
                 │ Ctrl+V            Paste                     │
                 │ Ctrl+A            Select all                │
                 │ V                 Select whole rows         │
                 │ Ctrl+Z            Undo                      │
                 │ Ctrl+Y            Redo                      │
                 │ >                 Widen column              │
                 │ <                 Narrow column             │
                 │ Tab               Next panel                │
                 │ Shift+Tab         Previous panel            │
                 │ /                 Filter                    │
                 │                                             │
                 ╰───── ↑↓ scroll · any other key closes ──────╯
